{
  "id": "blackboard-lesson",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "黑板教学",
  "keywords": [
    "黑板",
    "粉笔",
    "教学",
    "推导",
    "板书",
    "公式"
  ],
  "when": "需要把一堂课的推导过程按书写节拍逐笔写在黑板上时",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.code"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "sans-400",
      "body": "sans-400",
      "num": "latin-700",
      "caption": "sans-900",
      "hand": "ZTZiYouTi",
      "serif": "WenYuanSerifSC-Bold"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#FAF7F0",
      "ink": "#33312C",
      "muted": "#8B8578",
      "accent": "#E2574C",
      "line": "#D8D2C4"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "paper": "#FAF7F0"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.06,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1,
      "label": 0.8,
      "note": 0.6
    },
    "stroke": [
      3,
      6
    ],
    "pen": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "value": "chalk"
    },
    "board": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "value": "blackboard"
    },
    "forbid": [
      "把讲课内容写成 block 的题材枚举参数（例如用课题选项选择讲哪一课）",
      "在 code 里用 Math.random、Date 等墙钟随机，板书必须确定性",
      "黑板与卡片块混排，或同一幕出现两种字幕样式",
      "墨迹或文字越出 safeMargin",
      "把整段旁白原样抄进 code 当板书；code 只写推导与标注"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "plain",
    "font": "caption",
    "baseSize": 44,
    "lineHeight": 1.34,
    "top": 0.8,
    "at": "top",
    "size": 0.92,
    "maxWidth": 0.62
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "soft",
    "volume": 0.1,
    "fadeIn": 1.6,
    "fadeOut": 2.4,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.04,
      "edge": 0.22
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.06
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
